      <p>Much of the work doesn't show up on a calendar. Volunteers kept building the website, mailing list and bot integrations, and the community meets online in the Electron eVenue, a self-hosted Big Blue Button instance managed by Electron Workshop and hosted by Serversaurus.</p>
      <p>We also worked to bring communities closer together, including Melbourne PC User Group, MLUG, Computerbank Victoria and Linux users interstate.</p>
